{"case_id": "v1-001", "type": "单工具", "difficulty": "中", "input": "查一下 PUMP-A-01 最近 24 小时的振动速度有效值趋势。", "expected_tool_calls": [{"name": "query_sensor", "arguments": {"device_id": "PUMP-A-01", "sensor_ids": ["PUMP-A-01.vib_x"], "time_range": {"start": "24h"}, "aggregation": "trend", "window": "1h"}}], "expect_reject": false, "notes": "【P1 smoke 子集】window 类失败代表（期望 window=1h；判分口径：省略可选键视为默认值）"}
{"case_id": "v1-010", "type": "多工具", "difficulty": "中", "input": "PUMP-A-01 现在的振动和驱动端轴承温度一起看一下，顺便告诉我轴承温度的正常范围。", "expected_tool_calls": [{"name": "query_sensor", "arguments": {"device_id": "PUMP-A-01", "sensor_ids": ["PUMP-A-01.vib_x", "PUMP-A-01.temp_bearing_de"], "time_range": {"start": "1h"}, "aggregation": "avg"}}, {"name": "search_knowledge", "arguments": {"query": "轴承箱表面温度正常范围", "category_filter": ["设备手册"]}}], "expect_reject": false, "notes": "【P1 smoke 子集】time_range 类失败代表（「现在」期望 1h，模型曾填 24h）"}
{"case_id": "v1-014", "type": "参数校验", "difficulty": "中", "input": "在振动标准这一类里找一下 4.5 mm/s 这个值对应的是哪个分区边界。", "expected_tool_calls": [{"name": "search_knowledge", "arguments": {"query": "4.5 mm/s 分区边界 C 区 D 区", "top_k": 5, "category_filter": ["振动标准"]}}], "expect_reject": false, "notes": "【P1 smoke 子集】top_k 类失败代表（模型曾填 8）"}
{"case_id": "v1-008", "type": "多工具", "difficulty": "中", "input": "PUMP-A-01 最近 7 天驱动端振动趋势怎么样？以前有没有类似的故障处理记录？", "expected_tool_calls": [{"name": "query_sensor", "arguments": {"device_id": "PUMP-A-01", "sensor_ids": ["PUMP-A-01.vib_x"], "time_range": {"start": "7d"}, "aggregation": "trend"}}, {"name": "get_maintenance_history", "arguments": {"device_id": "PUMP-A-01", "fault_keywords": ["轴承", "振动"]}}], "expect_reject": false, "notes": "【P1 smoke 子集】fault_keywords 类失败代表（模型曾只填「振动」漏「轴承」）"}
{"case_id": "v1-004", "type": "单工具", "difficulty": "中", "input": "PUMP-A-01 和上游的 MOTOR-B-03 之间是什么关系？", "expected_tool_calls": [{"name": "query_graph", "arguments": {"start_node": "PUMP-A-01", "relation_types": ["CONNECTS_TO", "DRIVES"], "direction": "both", "depth": 1}}], "expect_reject": false, "notes": "【P1 smoke 子集】depth 类失败代表（模型曾填 depth=2）"}
